          "The Sprint Review comes after the Developers have finished the Sprint's work and before the [Sprint Retrospective](/project-management/scrum/sprint-retrospective/), which closes the Sprint. It is one of the five [Scrum events](/project-management/scrum/scrum-ceremonies/), alongside the Sprint itself, [Sprint Planning](/project-management/scrum/sprint-planning/) and the [Daily Scrum](/project-management/scrum/daily-scrum/).",
