            "**Separate Done from not Done.** List the items that meet the Definition of Done and briefly mention the ones that do not. Do not demonstrate unfinished work.",
            "**Let stakeholders use the Increment.** Hand over the keyboard, share a test link or walk a real scenario. Ask them to think aloud.",
